> Complete preserved experiment

Grid/cliff learning and the1000-run,300-episode maximization-bias comparison retain source budgets and RNG draws. Deep-copy table snapshots preserve independent estimates. Real terminality stops the bootstrap; truncation preserves it. All objectives, policy improvements, optimizer steps, collection and evaluation loops remain editable below. Additional checkpoint writes consume no RNG draws. Playback retains the original seeded episode computations; external videos are omitted.

